      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. the first and third ones are pretty good, they feel like actual luxury guests. that second one is actually super helpful too, it gives me a good baseline for how the engine handles mixed sentiment.\n\nthough, i noticed the scores you're attaching are a bit low for what i'm looking for. i need to see if the engine can handle the \"extreme\" end of the spectrum—like, what happens when a guest is absolutely blown away by everything. \n\ncan you try another set of 5 reviews? i need them to push the positivity index much higher, ideally into the 9.5-10 range. but again, please keep them realistic. i don't want a list of random adjectives; i want reviews that describe a perfect, flawless, once-in-a-lifetime stay. make sure they still feel like actual people wrote them, just very, very happy people.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
